        "id": 63071,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-14T21:30:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>1) You would still reveal cards until the end of the deck, if no underboss was found you would than shuffle your deck. The&nbsp;trash would remain untouched.</p><p>2) You would shuffle the entire trash back into the deck. So all those nasty thugs will be out of the trash!</p>",
