        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"arenson9\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arenson9/48/1900_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> arenson9:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<div><b>Ronway wrote:</b><br><blockquote>1) You would still reveal cards until the end of the deck, if no underboss was found you would than shuffle your deck. The&nbsp;trash would remain untouched.\n&nbsp;\n</blockquote></div>\n&nbsp;I don't think that's right, but I don't have The Operative in front of me. If she's revealing cards until the end of the deck, she'd just stop when she gets to the bottom of the deck. The Operative card doesn't say to reveal cards from the deck _and_ trash, does it?\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>Ahh, sorry. I just properly read what Ronway wrote. Never mind.</p>",
